<theodulf. carm. 53.1>	Eia meum solito noli convertere carmen;
<theodulf. carm. 53.2>	Ne vacuum redeat, more caveto tuo.
<theodulf. carm. 53.3>	Aut spumantis equis tua nunc vestigia retro
<theodulf. carm. 53.4>	Inpatiens calcet ungula, dona refer.
<theodulf. carm. 53.5>	Ceu rubicundo ostro Romae de nomine vestis,
<theodulf. carm. 53.6>	Quam vocitare patres, fac tibi colla premat.
<theodulf. carm. 53.7>	Veneris ut felix donatus munere pulcro,
<theodulf. carm. 53.8>	Accipias grates mille suave meas.
<theodulf. carm. 53.9>	Veneris at vacuus nostram si forsan ad aedem,
<theodulf. carm. 53.10>	Mille flagris caesus ibis, inepte, foras.
